## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - All 13 screen layout reference designs in `demo_menus` will be integrated into the React frontend.
> - Material Symbols Outlined icons and curated B2B InsurTech styling (Navy, Slate, Emerald, Amber, Crimson accents) will be incorporated.
> - Full traceability (Document -> Page -> Text Chunk -> Evidence -> Confidence Score) will be enabled across Policy Details, Evidence Viewer, and Comparisons.

